/// game/systems/
///
/// Systems contain pure logic that operates across multiple components.
///
/// Planned systems:
///   • ScrollingSystem  — moves the camera upward as the player rises (Phase 4)
///   • SpawnSystem      — procedurally places new platforms (Phase 5)
///   • BossSystem       — controls arena lock and boss AI (Phase 6)
///   • InputSystem      — translates raw input into a normalized X value (Phase 7+)
///
/// Systems intentionally do NOT extend FlameComponent.
/// They are plain Dart classes, which makes them easy to test in isolation.
library;
